2885 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( \174 January 2025  \023 Present\nDesigning the B2B digital fleet management experience for vehicle tracking\054 maintenance\054 and fleet operations\054 partnering with Product\054 Engineering\054 and stakeholders to improve operational efficiency and user experience\056\nDesigned the Fleet Manager experience for assigning vehicles\054 managing drivers\054 and enabling drivers to schedule service appointments independently\073 6 months after launch\054 24\045 of companies had adopted the feature\054 with 440\053 drivers and 400\053 assignments created in the platform\056\nSupported the integration of non\055connected vehicles into the product\056\nGeopolitical Risk Analysis Product \174 January 2023 \023 December 2024\nDesigned software used by internal buyers and risk analysts to assess geopolitical supply\055chain risks\054 support mitigation planning\054 and visualize relevant data\056 \nCollaborated closely with Product Designers and Product Managers to share responsibilities\054 exchange knowledge\054 and support product delivery\056 Also partnered with developers to analyze data and create accurate visualizations for the prototypes\056 \nPlanned and conducted ongoing user research\054 including interviews and usability validations\054 to gather insights and inform design decisions\056\nFacilitated ideation workshops with the team\054 translated concepts into sketches\054 and designed high\055fidelity prototypes\056 Also\054 organized and facilitated stakeholder workshops to align on roadmap priorities\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 2886 0 R
     /Pg 2845 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

